{"about":["Go behind enemy lines to forge your army, conquer Fortresses and dominate Mordor from within. Experience how the award winning Nemesis System creates unique personal stories with every enemy and follower, and confront the full power of the Dark Lord Sauron and his Ringwraiths in this epic new story of Middle-earth.","In Middle-earth™: Shadow of War™, nothing will be forgotten.","Uses DUALSHOCK 4 vibration function","Optional In-game purchases","Offline single player","One-time licence fee to download to multiple PS4 systems. Sign in to PlayStation is not required to use this on your primary PS4, but is required for use on other PS4 systems.","See Health Warnings for important health information before using this product."],"shots":[{"url":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/qfxnxpyj7dnjfxcfbhvg.jpg","thumb":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_screenshot_med/qfxnxpyj7dnjfxcfbhvg.jpg"},{"url":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/bgrkid38ifj8szgdx9y8.jpg","thumb":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_screenshot_med/bgrkid38ifj8szgdx9y8.jpg"},{"url":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/d5olq3gfovwdm8kifmav.jpg","thumb":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_screenshot_med/d5olq3gfovwdm8kifmav.jpg"},{"url":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/qrkvefuadtvpg5hbop5y.jpg","thumb":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_screenshot_med/qrkvefuadtvpg5hbop5y.jpg"},{"url":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/ijgi6z59kd9vxtb1djrt.jpg","thumb":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_screenshot_med/ijgi6z59kd9vxtb1djrt.jpg"},{"url":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/jap8yvyzwjx6wez2m8cm.jpg","thumb":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_screenshot_med/jap8yvyzwjx6wez2m8cm.jpg"},{"url":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_1080p/bzhreqzciyaheoourok7.jpg","thumb":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_screenshot_med/bzhreqzciyaheoourok7.